{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8c45ea051283cfcb62c7e22f48db83c5b5e995920cc21c3cb4a5e9440c0ebf2d", "ja": "（今日は、ジュリアの宣材写真を撮りに来た。\nだが、撮影は少し難航している……）", "zh": "（今天来拍摄茱莉亚的宣传照。\n不过，拍摄过程遭遇一些困难……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1001_camman", "source_sha256": "73c4690f820729873abaa02dab73149e3441424eafc9f8b0358eb6c654b6a265", "ja": "ジュリアさん。もう少し、\nアイドルらしい笑顔をお願いできますか？", "zh": "茱莉亚小姐，\n可以麻烦你笑得更像偶像一点吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "b10b11e8f161f5c7ea8073922aa2a52dcfe4f10042b441f9a165f9186f8bd47d", "ja": "う、うーん。\nアイドルらしく、って言われてもな……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯──\n说要像偶像，但要怎么做啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "23f5f0322bd5a9032164c7b4f7ec70685c4cf1496efb1ee23c0273f7ce695be8", "ja": "考えすぎても上手く行かないだろうし、\nいったん休憩しようか。", "zh": "太钻牛角尖应该也没有帮助，\n我看就先休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "24deb436ace316070329bee94381a89350ff98ac44dcfd6d5cab694f8f6e5aab", "ja": "{$P$}、助かったよ。正直、\nロックとジャンルが違いすぎてさ……。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢啦。说真的，\n这跟摇滚圈差别太大了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "8e856b7bc9287a1cd2c5d903bea09102ee3746af674da69e6ffdb26efdbd2073", "ja": "全然、わからないことだらけだ。なぁ、\n『アイドルらしく』って、どうすればいいんだ？", "zh": "我根本一头雾水。我问你哦，\n到底该怎么做才能『像个偶像』啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5e89a09977f3448601635f8e1c31716ff8c74c1f8db1c8534cf84d947e902ed4", "ja": "そうだな……。一般的なイメージだと、\n可愛らしくニッコリ笑ってる感じかな？", "zh": "这个嘛……以一般印象来说，\n应该是摆出可爱的微笑吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "528df524bdb05da3c62de91ac44df1b7d64c321e84c8af62cf6774728b96a644", "ja": "可愛らしくニッコリ、か。\nそりゃ、あたしから一番遠いやつじゃないか？", "zh": "可爱的微笑啊。\n那是跟我最无缘的东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "fb5ae680c83c13d715a889ecc5c136c08aa1c1e53ff42e387cc03b2ef59e1282", "ja": "……とはいえ、アイドルになるって言った以上、\n弱音吐いてる場合じゃないよな。どうするか……。", "zh": "……不过，既然都决定要当偶像了，\n这样悲观也不是办法。该怎么做呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b1bde2864fd7d2ba65b8dd6fb034580dc3687d47bb9fba318729e791f333f279", "ja": "そうだな……。無理に、アイドルらしくしようと\n考えなくてもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "其实……你也没必要\n勉强自己贴近偶像风格吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "1e388ae4d47cb0e56f97e82950e9555ac4c5a9773a054bdbbef1805626e84e9d", "ja": "は？\nでもそれじゃ、アイドルの写真にならないだろ。", "zh": "啊？\n可是不那样的话，要怎么拍出偶像的照片？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bd7d8413755cc92e51f08db6d7a82bc13e22e3ab8dfe457d50eeb65ec46b6316", "ja": "でも、無理に可愛くしようとしても、\n失敗するだけだと思うんだ。", "zh": "但是，我觉得要是你勉强装可爱，\n到头来也还是会失败。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "390853861755d202a7cf49c7764bbe5d837d5eb1867f2c2f487a647a8dbaba35", "ja": "それより、自然な表情を見せた方が、\nジュリアの魅力が伝わるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "与其那样，不如展现自然的表情，\n这样更能够表现出茱莉亚的魅力吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "6b5d77e38b8a75304c71bbd66077a3047feceb551efd33ecca9225ccce4e2c75", "ja": "{$P$}、それ……\nつまり、あたしは可愛くないってことか？", "zh": "{$P$}，你的意思……\n是在说我这个人根本不可爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1014_p", "source_sha256": "33c15407061ab1b6ce84e17d85652279555aaf919661d2f9c46a340adccf52a1", "ja": "い、いや！\nそういうつもりじゃなくて……！", "zh": "误、误会！\n我不是那个意思……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "07d5de2484f2b66754cb5307fa3a8bf7021dc5d84ab1961fd1151f0c874adf68", "ja": "ははっ、冗談だよ！\nあんたの言いたいことはわかってる。", "zh": "哈哈！开玩笑的啦！\n我知道你想表达什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "033832d47437cae4a29d2463bc87cb7510a61568835c2c9368fe630c33aa7f29", "ja": "確かに、無理したって、あたしらしくないよな。\nアドバイスどおりにやってみるよ。", "zh": "的确，就算我勉强配合，也只会失去自己的特色。\n我就照你的建议试试吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5ab9118e5b365e5e1f8b713095a9aac80d4ed31d025486a548d30d7789eac64e", "ja": "（その後……ジュリアは肩の力が抜けたのか、\n自然体で撮影に臨むことができた）", "zh": "（之后……可能是茱莉亚已经放松下来了，\n很自然地完成了拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "66eadf6878b5d4b09e77cbe8cce6108d03b9966b20da13617902f14412ce7792", "ja": "{$P$}、\nあんたの言ったとおりだったな。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n看来就跟你说的一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "06c826088d3e241f128977eee2366abcc3565b64edbdcc73e1644c52901b44e2", "ja": "最初はどうなることかと思ったけど、\n無事に撮れて良かった。サンキュ！　助かったぜ。", "zh": "我一开始还很担心，\n幸好顺利拍完了。谢啦！你的建议很有帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "05e4df2ce3827486ea79f89800c138d82a8db926cbc0ca81f4b03ecae64ceb19", "ja": "（ロッカーの雰囲気が残る、クールな表情……\nこれもジュリアの魅力のひとつだ）", "zh": "（潇洒的神情中还留着摇滚歌手的气质……\n这也是茱莉亚的魅力之一。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_002_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0e28056ac40ddab1f59172d77980567158d423cc09d0e5fefe87dcf1c1514787", "ja": "（ジュリアに惹きつけられるファンは必ずいる。\nこれからも、色々な魅力を見せていこう！）", "zh": "（一定会有粉丝深受茱莉亚吸引。\n以后也要继续让她展现出形形色色的魅力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
